    },
    {
      "type": "mobile",
      "e164": "+96171123456",
      "international": "+961 71 123 456",
      "national": "071 123 456",
      "note": "Mobile — 071 is an Alfa (MIC1) range"
    },
    {
      "type": "mobile",
      "e164": "+96170123456",
      "international": "+961 70 123 456",
      "national": "070 123 456",
      "note": "Mobile — 070 is a touch (MIC2) range"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Landline NSNs are 7 digits and mobile NSNs 8, so length distinguishes the two.",
    "The two mobile operators are known by their licence names MIC1 (Alfa) and MIC2 (touch)."
